  "落笔": {
    "行": [
      "$x+2y=4-2xy$。",
      "$x+2y\\ge2\\sqrt{2xy}$，所以 $4-2xy\\ge2\\sqrt{2xy}$。",
      "令 $u=\\sqrt{xy}>0$，得 $u^2+\\sqrt2\\,u\\le2$。",
      "两边加 $\\dfrac12$，得 $\\left(u+\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}2\\right)^2\\le\\dfrac52$。",
      "所以 $u\\le\\dfrac{\\sqrt{10}-\\sqrt2}2$。",
      "所以 $xy\\le3-\\sqrt5$。",
      "$x+2y=4-2xy\\ge4-2(3-\\sqrt5)=2\\sqrt5-2$。",
      "相等需要 $x=2y$。",
      "代入原条件，得 $4y+4y^2=4$，所以 $y^2+y-1=0$。",
      "写成 $\\left(y+\\dfrac12\\right)^2=\\dfrac54$。",
      "$y>0$，所以 $y=\\dfrac{\\sqrt5-1}2$、$x=\\sqrt5-1$。",
      "所以最小值为 $2\\sqrt5-2$。",
      "当且仅当满足下列取等条件时，所用的界成为最值：$x=2y$，解得 $x=\\sqrt5-1,y=(\\sqrt5-1)/2$。",
      "$x+2y=2\\sqrt5-2$，$2xy=6-2\\sqrt5$，两者相加为 $4$。"
    ],
